\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Macau Police brings the tracking expert police officer out of retirement to help catch a dangerous group of professional thieves.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1290821,\"title\":\"Shelter\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cv7DeQQ7TOozPoTCBdNJIvWKhU1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nHxWyy18SvAZ8jJeemtS8k1UNjM.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A man living in self-imposed exile on a remote island rescues a young girl from a violent storm, setting off a chain of events that forces him out of seclusion to protect her from enemies tied to his past.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1236045,\"title\":\"Animals\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iISM36voS1E8gX9BM0DVK0kgi3E.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5yzM78Tp8nYwSCQtyRcmnHmCn5C.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When the son of an L.A. mayoral candidate is kidnapped, he and his wife have a few hours to come up with the ransom payment. With most of their money spent on his political campaign, they have to get their hands dirty and expose a side of their lives they never intended to see the light of day.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1280738,\"title\":\"The Furious\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ivQ1Z3lI1xWvAeGDHBw3CCYZDGJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1AVF2fAevpfi2HP6AEpptG1kg8R.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Wang Wei's daughter is abducted by a criminal organization and law enforcement declines to intervene due to corruption, Wei embarks on a solo mission to find her. His sole ally is Navin, a determined journalist whose wife has also mysteriously disappeared. Together, this improbable pair confronts the kidnappers in a fierce martial arts confrontation, driven by an intense desire for retribution.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":866398,\"title\":\"The Beekeeper\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A7EByudX0eOzlkQ2FIbogzyazm2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f0ACHVpV707zqu4etZrXnWNdSgL.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"One man's campaign for vengeance takes on national stakes after he is revealed to be a former operative of a powerful and clandestine organization known as Beekeepers.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":385687,\"title\":\"Fast X\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fiVW06jE7z9YnO4trhaMEdclSiC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4XM8DUTQb3lhLemJC51Jx4a2EuA.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Over many missions and against impossible odds, Dom Toretto and his family have outsmarted, out-nerved and outdriven every foe in their path. Now, they confront the most lethal opponent they've ever faced: A terrifying threat emerging from the shadows of the past who's fueled by blood revenge, and who is determined to shatter this family and destroy everything—and everyone—that Dom loves, forever.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":87513,\"title\":\"Motor City\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rKws4iqKhrzWHVLHnwtMnCpEHhF.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l7asYmqOad01F2u0oCMM8nQjoEP.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 1970s Detroit, John Miller falls for a local gangster's girl and lands in prison for a crime he didn't commit. With his life ruined, Miller plots revenge against the man who took his girl away.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1242265,\"title\":\"Fuze\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oMFdQE5hMJ9JjhNORegwTo0GKmh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8wIaBCeGv3UhIn5CJOWQGHT1Cif.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An unexploded WWII bomb is discovered on a busy construction site in the centre of London. Chaos ensues as the military and police begin a mass evacuation against a ticking clock.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1621552,\"title\":\"Facing El Chapo\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/alpf5v4UqSFawPmG9RX03Or4BDk.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c4U96GrPRfnNrS01mBtqnocvlLJ.jpg\",\"rating\":8.7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two Mexican officers must survive the final hours of their shift after crossing a ruthless cartel boss.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":603692,\"title\":\"John Wick: Chapter 4\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vZloFAK7NmvMGKE7VkF5UHaz0I.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7I6VUdPj6tQECNHdviJkUHD2u89.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"With the price on his head ever increasing, John Wick uncovers a path to defeating The High Table. But before he can earn his freedom, Wick must face off against a new enemy with powerful alliances across the globe and forces that turn old friends into foes.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9693,\"title\":\"Children of Men\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k9IAS4TehZFcKi4HVByxZNPfqex.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8Y1S9BtmTOh86irwFo7CJ01YPXF.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 2027, in a chaotic world in which humans can no longer procreate, a former activist agrees to help transport a miraculously pregnant woman to a sanctuary at sea, where her child's birth may help scientists save the future of humankind.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"o0d1IA85D9o\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer [Subtitled]\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}